# Later onboarding (do not skip)

Onboarding order (current):

1. **Intro** → **Sign in with Apple** (required; no guest Continue).
   Apple fullName seeds the next step when available.
2. **Name** survey → Questions → Voice record → Voice preview.
   (No wake-time screen before recording — time is chosen on Create Alarm after paywall.)
3. **Allow alarms** — one screen: notifications then AlarmKit on Continue. If denied: bottom nudge on Home / Create Alarm → Settings. Do **not** also request Mic, Speech, or ATT here.
4. **Paywall** — single primary CTA (7-day free trial → monthly). Restore as a secondary text link (Apple requirement). No skip without a plan.

(Store-optimal alternative later: move Sign in back to after Voice preview if review prefers value-first.)

Just-in-time: Microphone + Speech on first Voice Record tap; no ATT.

Do not put long Clock.app / Focus explainers on Create Alarm — keep that screen clean. Wake is AlarmKit (real system alarm) with notification fallback.
